@startuml ssd8-cancel-appointment
title SSD - Cancel Appointment, with Offer Appointment to a Waitlisted Patient (success and failure scenarios)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor ":AdministrativeStaff" as staff
participant ":System" as sys

note over staff, sys : Precondition: user (administrative staff or patient) is identified and authenticated

staff -> sys : cancelAppointment(appointmentId)
sys --> staff : appointment cancelled, slot freed,\neligible waitlisted patients (by priority)

opt eligible waitlisted patients found (<<extend>> Offer Appointment to a Waitlisted Patient)
    note over staff, sys : Staff offers the freed slot by phone, based on priority
    staff -> sys : offerAppointment(entryId)
    sys --> staff : patient marked as offered
    alt patient accepts (main)
        note over staff, sys : Staff books it for the patient (Book Appointment, see SSD1)
        staff -> sys : acceptOffer(entryId)
        sys --> staff : patient taken off the waitlist
    else patient declines (FAILURE)
        note over staff, sys : Staff may remove the patient (Manage Waitlist, see SSD9)
    end
end

@enduml
